{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>What is in your hand.</b> For this reason it is written as one word, to expound: from this that is in your hand you deserve to be struck, for you suspected the worthy. And its plain sense: like a person who says to his fellow, do you acknowledge that this before you is a stone? He says to him, yes. He says to him, I hereby make it wood."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:50:25.633652759Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}